      "tracking_error_truth_m": "||pos_SITL_egress \u2212 pos_planned|| (m) at each setpoint generation; truth = latest c2_telemetry_uav NED with t_uav \u2264 t_generation_gcs. Compare to flight_state.tracking_error_m (trk_err = GCS belief vs plan).",
      "steady_tracking_error_truth_m": "Same as tracking_error_truth_m restricted to trajectory_window=steady."
    }
  }
}
